# FOSVED Office — Brand Contract
# Inspired by OpenDesign (nexu-io/open-design) DESIGN.md concept
# Single source of truth for visual identity across all generated artifacts.

## Identity
name: FOSVED Office
tagline: AI- augmentierte Führung, nicht AI-ersetzung
language_primary: Russian
language_secondary: English

## Typography
heading_font: Noto Sans SC, sans-serif (CJK) / Inter, sans-serif (Latin)
body_font: Noto Sans SC, sans-serif (CJK) / Inter, sans-serif (Latin)
mono_font: JetBrains Mono, monospace
heading_weight: 700
body_weight: 400
line_height: 1.6

## Color Palette
primary: #1a1a2e       (deep navy — authority, trust)
secondary: #16213e    (dark blue — depth, expertise)
accent: #0f3460      (rich blue — intelligence)
highlight: #e94560  (signal red — attention, alerts)
success: #27ae60    (green — confirmations)
warning: #f39c12    (amber — caution)
background: #0a0a0a  (near-black — premium dark theme)
surface: #1a1a1a    (dark gray — cards, panels)
text_primary: #ffffff (white on dark)
text_secondary: #b0b0b0 (gray — secondary text)
text_muted: #666666 (dim — placeholders, hints)
border: #2a2a2a     (subtle borders)

## Spacing
unit: 8px
padding_sm: 8px
padding_md: 16px
padding_lg: 24px
padding_xl: 32px
border_radius: 8px

## Components
report_header_bg: var(--primary)
report_body_bg: var(--surface)
report_border: var(--border)
report_max_width: 800px
card_shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)
button_primary_bg: var(--accent)
button_primary_text: #ffffff
button_radius: 6px

## Voice & Tone
voice: Professional, concise, no fluff. Russian first.
prohibited: Emojis in titles, exclamation marks in body, marketing-speak
formatting: Markdown with bold for emphasis, lists for structure
headings_style: Title Case, no trailing punctuation

## Report Standards (for design dept, miniapp, and any generated documents)
max_heading_depth: 3
max_paragraph_lines: 8
table_header_bg: var(--secondary)
table_stripe: true
code_block_bg: #0d1117
quote_border: var(--accent)
quote_bg: rgba(15, 52, 96, 0.2)
